  "result": "The node `NRS_484B_557_o1` passed the gate (`OK`) on its first run, out of a budget of 6. It reported 6 witnesses, 10 names, no composed rules and 1 narrowing that I declared.\n\nBefore that run I tried a second command (the gate with `--help`), which isn't allowed here. It was denied, nothing ran, and it didn't use a gate run. I've noted it in `task_result.md`.\n\n**The rule** (`library/TrafficSpec/Rules/NRS_484B/NRS_484B_557_o1.lean`):\n- **Who it applies to:** any member of the vehicle aggregate `DEF-NRS-484A-320::vehicle`.\n- **When it applies:** the car enters a railway crossing `x`. At the observation just before, it was in a travel region `r` governed by a stop sign `d`, and `r` and `x` lie on the same highway `h`.\n- **What it requires:** for every such crossing, region, highway and sign, the halt search must succeed.\n  - It searches back from the entry through the stopping zone: not on the crossing and within 50 ft of it.\n  - It looks for an observation where the car is halted (speed within `p.halt_speed_tolerance`), off the crossing, and between 15 ft and 50 ft away.\n  - The search stops where the car was last more than 50 ft out, or at its previous exit from the crossing.\n  - If it reaches the start of the recording while still inside the zone, the result is unknown.\n- **The one choice I made** (declared as a narrowing on s5): the search includes the observation where the car previously left the crossing. A halt there counts, but the search goes no further back.\n\n**The witnesses** (`library/TrafficSpecWitness/NRS_484B/NRS_484B_557_o1.lean`) all use one eastbound car, a lane, a crossing and a stop sign:\n\n| Witness | What happens | Verdict |\n|---|---|---|\n| `forbid` | Enters from 26 m out without stopping | violated |\n| `permit` | Halts 10 m out, then enters | compliant |\n| `idle` | The stop sign governs only the opposite lane | not applicable |\n| `blind` | Distances to the crossing are hidden; the car halts | unknown |\n| `history_boundary` | Recording starts with the car 12 m out; no halt is recorded | unknown |\n| `branch_1` | Halts only 3 m out, then enters | violated |\n\nFor reference, 50 ft is 15.24 m and 15 ft is 4.572 m.\n\n`task_result.md` is written in the working directory. I didn't write `dependency_defect.json`, since there is no concept defect to report.",
